Node ID=900 order templar knelt killer
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved. Within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had worn their cross and you had killed men wearing it. The order never found a way to put both facts on the same page. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly. Those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from. Inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service. Your name stayed in the rolls eleven years. Then it was struck out by a hand nobody signed for.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order templar unknelt killer
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved. No benefactor ever came to collect on them. You had killed men who wore the same cross you did. Then you spared the whole order by talking its creditor into its own death. The rolls have no line for that. They rebuilt slowly, under their own banners and out of their own treasury. The brothers who had buried the men you killed argued with the brothers who had read the Alamut dispatches. They argued for as long as any of them lived, and the order never settled it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order templar high knelt
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved. Within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had stood close enough to Javier to be counted among his own. When he knelt, there was no record of you being anywhere else. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly. Those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from. Inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service. The men who carried it there had trained under you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

