Node ID=900 order templar knelt
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved. Within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had taken their oath and fought under it. That was all the rolls had to say about you. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly. Those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from. Inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service. Nobody ever wrote to ask what you thought of it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
