Node ID=900 order inquisition dark
Text=The Inquisition entered the siege with a new head. Torquemada died in his own chambers, and the Holy Office recorded it as a fever. The truth was worse: the hand that killed him still wore the mark. Raphael knew. He took the chair within the year, and he burned more than Torquemada ever had, with better records. The cities paid for the wood. No one ever named you. He never needed to. The archive keeps a box with nothing written on it, and its keepers lower their voices.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order inquisition broken
Text=The Inquisition entered the siege with a new head. Torquemada died in his own chambers, at the hand of someone who owed the Holy Office nothing, and it recorded a fever. Raphael took the chair within the year. He burned more than Torquemada ever had, with better records. Within ten years, no city dared stop paying for the wood. No one in those cities knew your name. The Holy Office did. It kept the page open.
