Node ID=900 order saladin
Text=The Knights of Saladin kept the pact of east and west after the west had stopped keeping it. After Alamut they kept it alone. You had been their guest, and you had fought beside them in a season when their own numbers were thin enough that it mattered. They held the eastern shrines for two generations against raids the west never heard about. They were called weak for it by men who had never fought them. The order kept a short list of westerners who had been worth the hospitality. You were on it. In sixty years the list did not get any longer.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
