Node ID=900 order saladin shard scholar
Text=You brought the Shard of Dreams out of the slavers' lair and put it in Amir's hands. Then Kabool offered you the blade or your wits, and you chose your wits. He named you Scholar of the Crescent, a great honor among the people of the east. The order has told that story for sixty years. It has never once told it as a fight.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
