------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order saladin shard dervish
Text=You brought the Shard of Dreams out of the slavers' lair and put it in Amir's hands. Then Kabool offered you the blade or your wits, and you took the blade. You walked out of the Trial of Dreams with a Sacred Scimitar, forged in the image of Saladin's own. The order still teaches its novices how you fought. Few of them ever manage it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
