------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order saladin scimitar scholar
Text=Amir offered you a choice of tasks, and you took the sword. Eduardo forged it, you carried it back, and Amir handed it to you again. Then Kabool offered you the blade or your wits, and you chose your wits, with the blade at your side the whole time. He named you Scholar of the Crescent. The order found that very funny. Later it found it wise.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
