------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order saladin scimitar dervish
Text=Amir offered you a choice of tasks, and you took the sword. Eduardo forged it, you carried it back, and Amir handed it to you again. You took it into the Trial of Dreams and you won. Kabool said a second blade would be no gift, and he closed his hand around yours. When he opened it the steel was burning. It did not stop. The order still asks what became of it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

