Text=The Inquisition entered the siege with a new head. Torquemada died in his own chambers, at the hand of someone who owed the Holy Office nothing, and it recorded a fever. Raphael took the chair within the year. He burned more than Torquemada ever had, with better records. Your gold paid for the first of the wood. Within ten years, no city dared stop paying for the rest. The receipt is in the archive, made out to a penitent. It is the only page with your name on it.
