Node ID=900 order inquisition dark sede
Text=The Inquisition entered the siege without a head, and without the man who would have been the next one. You had worn its mark, and you killed them both. Nobody was left to write a fever. The Holy Office lost its chair and its story in the same week. His would-be successors agreed on nothing, and the fires burned low. Within ten years, some cities stopped paying for the wood. The archive keeps your name under a heading it invented for the purpose. Nobody has ever been entered there since.
