Node ID=900 order relican hunted
Text=Cedric sent you after Relican, and you found the exile in the western forest and destroyed him. Nothing in La Calle Perdida marked it. The Wielders had cast him out once already, and they do not celebrate their own. Cedric heard your report and called you Wielder. The street slept well after that. Few of those sleeping there knew who to thank.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
