Node ID=900 order relican cured
Text=Relican cursed a vitality potion, and Brambles stood rooted in La Calle Perdida for years because of it. Quinn could not cure him. You took the cure from Relican himself. You poured the potion on Brambles's roots. The tree split, and there was a man inside it, stiff in the legs and late for his grandchildren. He thanked you and went to find them. The street has one less tree in it, and nobody there has ever been sorry.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order relican dark joined joined
Text=Relican made you a Dark Wielder, and he made you work for it. You bent Quinn the herbalist with your words, and he served Relican faithfully. Leonardo gave you his word that he would not stand against Relican. He kept it, and he did not forgive himself. Brambles stayed a tree. He creaked at you whenever you passed, and it could have been the wind. There was no one left in Barcelona who would say your name and his in the same breath.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
