Node ID=900 order savage heart betrayed
Text=The Savage Heart came out of the war the way mercenary companies do, which is richer and with a shorter roster. One of the names on the short side was Raylark's. You took his contract, and then you took the Khan's, and you carried the Everlasting into Khara'Khorum to prove you had earned it. The company does not avenge its dead. It prices them. The price it set on you was entered in the company's books and never once collected. In the years after Alamut the Savage Heart turned away more work than it could staff. None of it was ever yours, and that was the whole of its revenge.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
