Node ID=900 order pits freed
Text=Don Alfonso de Cardona went home, and his family's gratitude lasted longer than most. He told the story of the slave pits at table for thirty years. In his version he broke the chain himself. Your name came up once a year, at the feast of his return, and the house of Cardona paid for one mass in it. Nobody there knew what you had been doing in that yard.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
