Node ID=900 order pits sold
Text=Don Alfonso de Cardona was entered in the Holy Office's ledger as a heretic, which was cheaper than admitting what he was worth. His family paid a ransom for two years to men who no longer had him. You had the money by then. The house of Cardona never learned who sold him. It is still looking.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
