Node ID=900 order standard
Text=The English at the crossroads woke in one moment, in the wrong country, with blood on them. Most of them went home. Nobody in England would hear what had happened, because the druids had already told it differently. The men stopped talking about it. You knew what you had broken, and you were the only one who did.
