Node ID=900 order standard blood
Text=The English at the crossroads woke in one moment, in the wrong country, with blood on them. You drew blood among them while they were still asking where they were. The rest went home and told nobody, because nobody in England would have heard it. You knew what you had broken, and you knew what you had done after.
