Node ID=900 friend cortes shylocke
Text=You found for the moneylender. He took the ship inside a fortnight and sold it inside a month. Cortes said, "And here I thought you would vindicate me." After that he had nothing to say to you. He drank in La Serpienta Vieja, on credit a landlord extended out of pity. He never reached the cave, and the treasure is still in it. Shylocke returned the favour with a cheaper loan.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
