Node ID=900 friend joan
Text=Jehanne d'Arc left the Crypt of the Bleeding Lance after two hundred years and went back to France. She was still a corpse, and she did not hide it. Soldiers followed her anyway, for a while. She had crowned a King of France once, and she kept clear of kings. The Council stayed silent. She asked after you once, as the crusader. Nobody in France could say who that was.
Should Have Voiceover=1

