Node ID=900 friend joan dead
Text=Jehanne d'Arc died in your service, after two hundred years of holding one gallery. This time no wish kept her standing. The Templars never recorded who carried the Bleeding Lance after her. People remembered her as the maid, the commander, the witch or the saint, whatever the year required. A chapel outside Orleans carried her name within a century. The men who built it could not have named the relic she had guarded.
Should Have Voiceover=1

