Node ID=900 friend joan released
Text=Jehanne d'Arc stopped. Two hundred years of holding one gallery ended in a wish you worded to an efreet. She thanked you and passed the guarding of the relic into your keeping. Then she went to the place beyond. The souls of her knights were freed by the same wish. The Spirit Council never explained itself to anybody. What was left in that crypt afterwards was ordinary stone, for the first time in two centuries.
