Node ID=900 friend grumdjum
Text=Grumdjum got his verse. He delivered it at length, in a hall full of goblins who had never seen Alamut. It was accurate about the fighting and ruinous about everything else. The meter was a bit off. You are in it as the dark knight. He outlived three Khans by being the only goblin anyone wanted to hear. Goblin children still recite the Alamut stanza, badly. In it he eats the Old Man's brain.
