Node ID=900 friend grumdjum dead
Text=Grumdjum went to the stewpot beyond before his verse was finished. The lines he had already made were remembered correctly for about ten years. Then they merged with four other poems about four other goblins. The composite hero is braver than Grumdjum and much less funny. Nobody who recites it knows you are in it. The hall he would have used was still standing eighty years later. It was never used for poetry again.
