Node ID=900 friend grumdjum killed
Text=Grumdjum died in the Wilderness at your hands, with his new poem unfinished. His own guards had called hearing it a misfortune. Goblins who knew pieces of it argued about the pieces for a season, and then stopped. He had been the clever one, by the Khan's own account. Bloodspiller the Pensive and Bonecrusher the Pedantic lost their last reader. Nobody finished the poem, and no goblin asked anybody to.
