Node ID=900 friend diego
Text=Bishop Diego's eyes went entirely inside two years, and he kept working. He was given a reader and a boy to lead him, and he outlasted both posts. He heard confession in a stone room on the plains. He got more out of voices than he had ever got out of faces. The Inquisition left him there, because moving him needed a decision. He called everyone "my child" to the last, at about ninety.
Should Have Voiceover=1

