Node ID=900 friend diego dead
Text=Bishop Diego died on the plains, with his eyes most of the way gone. He had gone out with you knowing how little he could see. His post stood unfilled for six years. Shepherds buried him under a cairn and kept adding to it. Nobody local could say what the old man had been doing there. They knew only that he had called them "my child", and had meant it.
