Node ID=900 friend darsh
Text=Inquisitor Darsh reported to the Grand Inquisitor and wrote his rescue up as a tactical withdrawal. He was promoted on it. The goblins had held him for days and taken an ear. His report mentioned a young one who was present. He ran the Wilderness chapter for eleven years. He concealed more heretics than he burned, and never said why. He was buried in the chapter house with full honours, the withdrawal cited by name.
Should Have Voiceover=1

