Node ID=900 friend darsh dead
Text=Inquisitor Darsh died on the way home to Barcelona. He had been a prisoner for days, and he was an ear short when you found him. He had wanted every goblin in the village dead, and he did not live to see it. The Inquisition recorded a tragic ending to a loyal Inquisitor. Nobody senior asked how he had got out. The part you did went unrecorded, in an archive that recorded everything.
