Node ID=900 friend darsh eaten
Text=Inquisitor Darsh never left the goblin village. The goblins had sent Barcelona his severed ear with a ransom note, and the Inquisition did not bargain. Then the goblins did what goblins do. The camp argued for a fortnight over the red spice and the grey. The grey won by a narrow margin. The Inquisition recorded a tragic ending to a loyal Inquisitor. The Khan's daughter was not consulted, and she remembers it differently.
