Text=The Knight of Saladin reported to his order, at length and accurately. He was not entirely believed about the Old Man. He spent the rest of his service training men for fortresses like Alamut. There would be another, he reasoned. He opened every greeting with Salaam, and his students copied it without understanding why. Your name went into his report, spelled three different ways in the same paragraph.
