Node ID=900 friend saladin knight dead
Text=The Knight of Saladin died at Alamut. He had offered you his service in the first minute of knowing you, and he kept the offer. His report was never written. What lay inside the fortress stayed a rumour in the east for two generations. Then people stopped discussing it at all. The men he would have trained were trained by somebody else, less well. His order learned where he fell, and very little else.
